      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūja kū būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbūūka kūja kū būlūgū kwilwisha na banishi bako, ūbona gīkī balī na falasa na magogoteni mingī ga būlūgū, nī libità lyabo līl'itaale kūtinda ī lyako, yaya ū kūbogoha; nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūyo wakwenha kūfuma sī ya Misili akūbiza hamò nang'ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyegeela kūshika ikanza lya kūja kū būlūgū, ū ngabīji ize ū kū bashilikale ahooye nabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abawīle, “Igwagi gete Baisilaeli, ī lelo mulīfuma kūja kwilwisha būlūgū na banishi bing'we. Mutizūhaahūūka nūūlū kogoha, yaya ū kūdetema nūūlū kūbbaha ū kūbūtongi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīja hamò ning'we; hū ng'wene ūyo akūmulwīlīīla ū kū banishi bing'we ang'winhe būpyeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a batongeeji ba mabità ga bashilikale bakūhooya nabo babawīle, “Alīho nani ūyo wazengile numba haha ītaalī mhya, ataalī nūūlū kwītūūla mu makono ga ng'wa SEEBA? Ni ashokage kaya atizūchīla kū būlūgū ī numba yenīyo īkatūūlwa na ūngī ū kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū alīho nani a henaha ūyo walīmile ngūnda gwa mizabibu haha, alīyo ataalī kwandya ū kūgalūmba a matwajo gaamo? Ni ashokage kaya, atizūchīla kū būlūgū a matwajo ga mu ngūnda gwakwe gakalūmva na ūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo alīho munhū a henaha walūngije nkīma haha, gwike ataalī ū kū ntoola? Ni ashokage kaya atizūchīla kū būlūgū ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akatoolwa na ūngī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a batongeeji ba bashilikale bakongeja kūhaya, “Hamo alīho ose ose ogohaga? Ni ajage kaya atizūbenheleja na biye kogoha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji ba bashilikale ūlū būmala ū kūhooya na a mabità, bakūbakomanya bamò babo babatūūle kūbiza bataale ba mabità.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbadumīla banishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbūūka kūja kūbadumīla banhū mu nzengo nebe, gīkī ūlwe nabo būlūgū, binhage tame ng'wanya gwa kūhooya nang'ho mihayo ya kūtūūla mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būzunya, būkūlekela wingīla ū mu nzengo gwabo, pye a banhū ba ng'wene bakūbiza batūmami bako, bakūbeeja pyī ī milīmo yako īyo ūlabatūme kūbeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū būlema ū kūhooya, bandya kūkūdumīla kwilwisha nang'ho būlūgū, ū nzengo gwabo gūtūūlīlage mabità ga bashilikale gagūpīndīlīje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūlū ūgūtūūla mu makono gako ū nzengo gwenūyo, pye a bagoosha ūkūbabūlaga na līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo a bakīma na a baana nī mitugo, pyī nī shingī ī sha mu nzengo gwenūyo, ūkūsola ūpandīke nding'wa. Ī shose īsho alakwinhe ū SEEBA Mulungu wako kūfuma ū mu banishi bako ūdūgije kūtūmamīla gīt'ūmo ūtogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkwīyītīla gīko pyī ī mizengo īyo īlī ka kūle nang'ho, ī mizengo ya mahanga ayo gatī bbihī nang'ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu mizengo ya mahanga ayo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kūbiza wingīji wako, ūtizūlekeela mo shose shose īsho shikesheemaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagajaga pye pye pye gete; a Bahītī, Baamoli, Bakanani, Bapelizi, Bahīvī, na a Bayebusi, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako wakūlagīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batizūbiza ba kūkūlanga kūshimīzīla mu mihayo ya malofu yose yose, īyo bakītūmamīlaga mu kūbalamya bamulungu babo. Ūlū wīta gīko ūkūng'hūba no ū SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūgūpīndīlīja nzengo gose gose n'ibità mukūlwaga nago gīkī mugūsole, hūna ng'ūkwīja ī shikū mulīho a h'ipandī lyenīlo, yaya ū kwīkenaagūla ī mitī mukwībbutagūlaga na mbasa, nguno mukūyūūlya; mutizīgwisanja. Ī gīsī, ī mitī ya mu makūngū yabizaga banhū nose ng'wilwishe nayo a bing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene mudūgije ū kūbbuta ī mitī īyo ng'wīdeebile gīkī ītī na matwajo ga kūlyiwa. Ī yenīyo mudūgije ū kūzengela ī nhala ja būlūgū ūlū mugūpīndīlīgije ū nzengo gwenūyo kūshisha mugūgwishe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
